Package: ocrinfer
Type: Package
Title: Statistical Evaluation of OCR and Handwritten Text Recognition
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Florian",
    family = "Cafiero",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "florian.cafiero@epita.fr"
  )
Description: Tools for reproducible evaluation of optical character recognition
    (OCR) and handwritten text recognition (HTR) outputs. The package provides
    Unicode-aware text normalization, grapheme- and codepoint-level alignment,
    character and word error rates, edit-operation summaries, and tidy
    row-level evaluation. Later releases will add hierarchical aggregation,
    paired system comparison, bootstrap uncertainty, sensitivity analysis,
    and error-profile visualisation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports:
    stringi
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
